* TVS and zener stand-ins for the reverse-polarity sim. NOT vendor models; kept with this
* study because nothing else uses them. Q1 uses Vishay's Si2309CDS model (shared/spice_models).
*
* SMAJ33CA bidirectional TVS as two series zeners (breakdown 36.7 V min per the SMAJ family).
.subckt SMAJ33CA a b
D1 a m DTVS
D2 b m DTVS
.ends SMAJ33CA
.model DTVS D(IS=1e-12 N=1 RS=0.3 BV=36.7 IBV=1m CJO=1n)
*
* SMAJ28A unidirectional TVS on each sensor supply (breakdown 31.1 V min per the SMAJ family).
.model DTVS28 D(IS=1e-12 N=1 RS=0.3 BV=31.1 IBV=1m CJO=1n)
*
* BZT52C15 15 V zener (gate-source clamp).
.model DZ15 D(IS=1e-14 N=1 RS=5 BV=15 IBV=5m CJO=40p)
